The  echo  service  module  for PAM displays its arguments to the
user, separated by spaces, using the current  conversation  func‐
tion.  If the character occurs anywhere in the arguments to it is
assumed  to  introduce one of the following escape sequences: The
name of the host on which the client  runs  The  current  service
name  The  name  of the controlling tty The applicant’s user name
The target account’s user name Any other  two‐character  sequence
beginning  with expands to the character following the character.
